@startuml
title The Smallest Agent - Flutter / FastAPI / Python Agent SDK
autonumber
actor "Student / Browser" as Browser
participant "Flutter client" as UI
participant "FastAPI route / service" as API
participant "Python Agent SDK / CLI" as SDK
participant "Claude API" as Claude
Browser -> UI: Run agent(prompt)
UI -> API: POST /api/agent/stream
alt Valid prompt and configured key
  API -> API: Validate; tools disabled
  API -> SDK: stream_agent() / query()
  SDK -> Claude: Prompt; no built-in tools
  Claude --> SDK: Model response
  note over API, SDK: Lifecycle messages can arrive while inference runs.
  loop Each intermediate SDK message
    SDK --> API: Safe SDK message (projected by service)
    API --> UI: SSE message event
    UI --> Browser: Update Flutter state
  end
  alt Final result received
    SDK --> API: ResultMessage fields
    API --> UI: SSE ResultMessage
    UI --> Browser: Render answer + metrics (respect is_error)
    API --> UI: SSE done event
  else SDK failure or missing final result
    API --> UI: SSE error; no done
    UI --> Browser: Error + snackbar
  end
else Missing key or invalid prompt
  API --> UI: Key: SSE error / input: 422
end
@enduml
